{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Hey Deb! So sorry for the late reply, been super busy. Last weekend my partner and I traveled to a meditation retreat for a few weeks in Phuket. Amazing experience! Nature, reflection and a break from engineering studies were awesome - it helped me find inner peace."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-76bd4346b3269c42254c7384", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:39:26.659012+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "76bd4346b3269c42254c7384", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "76bd4346b3269c42254c7384", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: I'd love to hear more about your reflections there and how they changed you."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-065ba2891e59796e8a6935d6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:39:30.773938+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "065ba2891e59796e8a6935d6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "065ba2891e59796e8a6935d6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: At the retreat, I had time to reflect on what makes me happy. It made me realize the importance of incorporating relaxation, self-care, and balance in life alongside my engineering studies. The beauty of nature there was so inspiring and refreshing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-4c0af6f227813f17c110b8d6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:39:34.915195+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4c0af6f227813f17c110b8d6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4c0af6f227813f17c110b8d6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Was there anything from the retreat that stood out to you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-3c71a08057778feca0824d8a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:39:39.068958+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3c71a08057778feca0824d8a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3c71a08057778feca0824d8a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: The one session that really stood out was about releasing expectations and judgments and just savoring the present. It was a strong reminder to not just dwell on the finish line, but to appreciate the journey too. I usually get too consumed with hitting my goals that I forget to appreciate the ride."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-d0eeec86e64e824145d9c07b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:39:43.233018+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d0eeec86e64e824145d9c07b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d0eeec86e64e824145d9c07b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: I've been thinking about this a lot, too. Life's full of small moments and being grateful for those can really boost our happiness."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-a8499004b35f248c416f914f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:39:47.356430+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a8499004b35f248c416f914f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a8499004b35f248c416f914f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Yup, totally agree! Sometimes we get too focused on the big stuff and don't appreciate all the tiny wins. Like the feeling of the sun or a great cup of coffee - can be small but they make life much better. Trying to be more mindful and grateful to take it all in now."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-0fe5001f5244a5a234dba987", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:39:51.463269+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0fe5001f5244a5a234dba987", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0fe5001f5244a5a234dba987", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: That's great, Jolene! Practicing mindfulness and gratitude can really change our day-to-day. Even just a different outlook can make the little things in life joyful. Glad you're getting into it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-74d6c017a3c02bb55de9cd89", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:39:55.568444+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "74d6c017a3c02bb55de9cd89", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "74d6c017a3c02bb55de9cd89", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I'm experiencing a new level of joy and happiness!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-465d33bc313e3334b60f74f8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:39:59.663988+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "465d33bc313e3334b60f74f8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "465d33bc313e3334b60f74f8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: It's wonderful to see your progress, and I'm excited to be on this journey with you!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-e6e6cb4630440d6b313fefcf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:40:03.804947+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e6e6cb4630440d6b313fefcf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e6e6cb4630440d6b313fefcf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks, Deb! Appreciate your support. It's great that we can do this together."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-9c1949f781f58c37e878bc87", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:40:07.916358+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9c1949f781f58c37e878bc87", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9c1949f781f58c37e878bc87", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Having a supportive community definitely helps. We can motivate and encourage each other! By the way, I recently played a game. I don't remember what it's called. This is a card game about cats, where you take cards one by one from a deck, and then you can attack your opponent with them. We'll definitely play it with you!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-1d8c66d5cfc85f5380509d16", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:40:12.025808+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1d8c66d5cfc85f5380509d16", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1d8c66d5cfc85f5380509d16", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I look forward to meeting you and playing this game!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_27-732ff14b656227e3693eed65", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T12:40:16.148599+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "732ff14b656227e3693eed65", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "732ff14b656227e3693eed65", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
